# Copy to .env.local and set your machine's LAN address.
#
# NOT localhost: on the phone that means the phone itself. Find your address
# with `ipconfig` (Windows) or `ifconfig | grep inet` (macOS/Linux), and make
# sure the phone is on the same network.
#
# Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* at BUILD time, and only via a static
# `process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` reference - destructuring or bracket access
# will not work. Restart the dev server after changing this.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.x:8000
